# Title: Suspicious Calculator Usage
# ID: 737e618a-a410-49b5-bec3-9e55ff7fbc15
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2019-02-09
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036
# Description: Detects suspicious use of 'calc.exe' with command line parameters or in a suspicious directory, which is likely caused by some PoC or detection evasion.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_exec="*\\calc.exe *") OR ((process_path="*\\calc.exe") AND NOT (((process_path="*:\\Windows\\System32\\*" OR process_path="*:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*" OR process_path="*:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*")))))
